Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [gcc 15 specific workaround]

GCC 15 with -std=c++17 rejects the implicit conversion from
std::string_view to std::string in CameraModel(). The ternary has
incompatible types (string_view vs string). Wrap *model in an
explicit std::string() constructor.

--- a/core/rpicam_app.cpp
+++ b/core/rpicam_app.cpp
@@ -129,7 +129,7 @@
 std::string RPiCamApp::CameraModel() const
 {
 	auto model = camera_->properties().get(properties::Model);
-	return model ? *model : camera_->id();
+	return model ? std::string(*model) : camera_->id();
 }
 
 void RPiCamApp::OpenCamera()
